# spore-as-project (dogfood) harness artifacts
/state.md
# Skills installed by `repo-mapped` from the spore binary's BundledSkills
# embed. Source lives at bootstrap/skills/, so committing this snapshot
# would create a drift target. Downstream consumers (no embed source
# in-tree) commit their .claude/skills/; spore-as-project does not.
/.claude/skills/
# Implementation plans are scaffolding, not documentation: on disk for
# the run, deleted once executed. Workers get plan content through their
# brief. The spec each plan serves stays tracked. See rules/core/tier-policy.md.
/docs/todo/*-plan.md
# Scenario drafts for `spore research judge draft`: imported by
# `judge approve --from`, never committed.
/research-drafts/
